    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38499" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεισ-ᾰγωγή</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing</i>
			
			<i>in besides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτέρων ἰητρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Praec.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; esp. of a second wife, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				11.6.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσώπων ἐ.</span>
			<i>introduction of new</i> characters, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Vett.Cens.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i> (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.3
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρείττονος ἐλπίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					7.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>means of bringing</i> or <i>letting in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεσαγωγὰς τῶν πολεμίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.92
				</span></i>
			.</div>
